A REQUEST, WHICH IS NOT A CONDITION

The licence above is plain MIT and asks nothing of you beyond keeping the
copyright notice. What follows is a request, and you are free to ignore it
without breaching anything.

If you put this in front of users, please keep the credit line the widget
renders for you, or write your own:

    Credit freeze letters by Klagge Law, PLLC
    <a href="https://stepuplaw.com">stepuplaw.com</a>

A plain link, one that search engines can follow, is the entire ask. We built
this for our own clients, giving it away costs us nothing, and that link is
what makes maintaining it worth doing. It is also how corrections reach you:
when a bureau moves a post office box, we find out because people arrive from
that link and tell us.

The credit identifies where the tool came from. It does not mean Klagge Law,
PLLC endorsed or reviewed your product, and it creates no attorney-client
relationship with you or with anyone who uses it.
